data/staging/

# Manufacturer catalogs are redistribution-limited and must never be committed.
# Scoped deliberately: the synthetic fixtures under tests/fixtures/ are NOT
# manufacturer data and must stay tracked (a blanket *.agf rule once silently
# dropped tests/fixtures/demo.agf and broke CI).
data/manufacturers/**/*.agf
data/manufacturers/**/*.AGF

# The refractiveindex.info pages under data/spectral/ are CC0 1.0 public-domain
# optical constants, so they ARE committed: they are the provenance for every
# crystal row in the database, and unlike the .agf catalogs above they may be
# redistributed. Un-ignore explicitly so this stays intentional rather than
# depending on the absence of some other rule.
!data/spectral/refractiveindex_info/
!data/spectral/refractiveindex_info/**

g2.log

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
.streamlit/secrets.toml
